gle word that is still longer than that budget is left whole. The ring then turns red, ",[129,189,190],{},"hsl(0, 90%, 45%)",", because the published post can exceed the limit.",[95,193,194],{},"Send opens one of these addresses, with the current post encoded on the end:",[196,197,198,204,209,214],"ul",{},[199,200,201],"li",{},[129,202,203],{},"https:\u002F\u002Fx.com\u002Fintent\u002Ftweet?text=",[199,205,206],{},[129,207,208],{},"https:\u002F\u002Fbsky.app\u002Fintent\u002Fcompose?text=",[199,210,211],{},[129,212,213],{},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.threads.net\u002Fintent\u002Fpost?text=",[199,215,216],{},[129,217,218],{},"https:\u002F\u002Fmastodon.social\u002Fshare?text=",{"title":220,"searchDepth":221,"depth":221,"links":222},"",2,[223],{"id":179,"depth":221,"text":180},"The four character limits and what changes when you switch.","md",null,{},true,{"title":28,"description":224},"Epy0ii5Out4eqVo2wsEpw7ilzetta4hCuzPLYyqEJw4",[232,234],{"title":24,"path":25,"stem":26,"description":233,"children":-1},"The parts of the page and what each one is for.",{"title":32,"path":33,"stem":34,"description":235,"children":-1},"How counters and the custom bridge are written into each post.",1792868107566]